  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Battery Manufacturer Directory</h1>
      <p>A directory of battery manufacturers with verified company data. Click a manufacturer for its entity page. Company-level facts are cross-checked; certifications are recorded as claimed until independently accredited.</p>

      <h2>How listings are verified</h2>
      <p>Every listing distinguishes a <em>claim</em> from an <em>independently accredited</em> certification. See the <a href="/verification-criteria/">verification criteria</a> and the <a href="/product-verification/">product-level verification</a> examples.</p>

      <h2>Directory</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Company</th><th>Country</th><th>Chemistry</th><th>Verification</th><th>Battery types</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {items.map((m) => (
            <tr>
              <td><a href={`/manufacturers/${m.id}/`}><strong>{m.name}</strong>{m.chinese ? ` (${m.chinese})` : ''}</a></td>
              <td>{m.country}</td>
              <td>{m.chemistry}</td>
              <td>{levelLabel(m)}</td>
              <td>{m.products}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>Download the dataset</h2>
      <p>Machine-readable exports of the directory, free under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a> with attribution:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/manufacturers.json">manufacturers.json</a> — full directory data (50 companies, verification levels per dimension)</li>
        <li><a href="/manufacturers.csv">manufacturers.csv</a> — flat table for spreadsheets</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Related</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/china-lead-acid-manufacturers/">China lead-acid battery manufacturers</a> — the majors and the long tail</li>
        <li><a href="/lithium-ev-manufacturers/">Lithium EV battery manufacturers</a> — market share and concentration</li>
        <li><a href="/european-battery-manufacturers/">European battery manufacturers</a> — Varta, Saft, ACC, PowerCo</li>
        <li><a href="/korean-japanese-battery-manufacturers/">Korean &amp; Japanese battery manufacturers</a> — LG, SK, Samsung, Panasonic, GS Yuasa, AESC</li>
        <li><a href="/indian-battery-manufacturers/">Indian battery manufacturers</a> — Amara Raja, Exide Industries</li>
        <li><a href="/us-battery-manufacturers/">US battery manufacturers</a> — Clarios, EnerSys, Tesla, LG, SK On, Panasonic</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="muted">Return to <a href="https://worldbatteryhub.com">World Battery Hub</a>. Data is researched from public sources and cross-verified; it is informational, not purchasing advice.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
